  "id": "verbal-conditioning",
  "term": "verbal conditioning",
  "definition": "Verbal conditioning is the idea that a word’s sound pattern can become directly linked to an emotional response through experience. In this view, hearing or saying a particular word form can trigger affect even when another expression with a similar meaning does not.",
